window.products.push({"id":586215,"name":"Weicai 2 Pack Digital Kitchen Timer with Premium Magnetic Backing for Cooking, Baking and More (LCD Display, Loud Alarm, Countdown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7147XYgxs5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Weicai Cooking Timer for Your Needs: Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned chef, this professional kitchen timer has the simplicity and practicality to create the perfect kitchen creations make cooking that a whole lot easier, and we all know how important it is to cook our food at the right duration. Sure, most modern cookers do have timers but the digits are usually small to read, the alarm not so loud and you cannot move the timer to the next room to keep an eye on it.This product is made of high quality plastic and boasts super large digits and this will improve your user experience. Timer can count up and down so can be used as a stopwatch as well as a countdown timer. Ideal for cooking food, homework, gym workout, sport, game, time out (for kids), office and classroom timing activities. The maximum time set is 99 minutes and 59 seconds. The timer will remember the last setting, which is useful for repetitive activities.You have 3 different choices for placement the digital timer. Either stick it to the fridge door with its premium magnet, or use the pull out stand for table-top use, and finally you can run a piece of string through the hook and hang it on a wall hook or around your neck if you are on the go. Product Features： Big digits in large LCD screen With switch to adjust volume 99 minutes 59 seconds count up/down Setting memory for the previous timing Variety of placement with magnetic, hanging hole and stand back Automatic shutdown without any operations after 10 minutes, to save battery life Friendly Tips: Tear off the protective plastic film on the screen for the first time use. Need to run an AAA battery (Not Included), please note the correct polarity when install it. Long press the \"M\" or \"S\" button for 2 seconds can adjust the time faster. When the display screen is dim or alarm is not clear enough, please change to the new battery.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7147XYgxs5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Weicai","source_asin":"B07KKCG9QX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KKCG9QX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KKCG9QX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
