window.products.push({"id":586404,"name":"Wstan Solar Rope Lights, Warm White Fairy Lights 8 Modes IP65 Waterproof Upgraded Powered Panel 32.8FT 100 LED Outdoor Rope Lights for Gazebo Bistro P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bUoYuKk-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Solar powered: The solar powered string lights are charging energy from the solar panel. Freeing you from any electricity bill and troubles for finding outdoor power outlets. Intelligent tube lights equipped with light sensor chip, absorbing solar energy during the day and automatically turn on at night. Note: Expose the solar panel in the sunlight 6-8 hours directly for a full charge and light up 10-12 hours. Malleable PVC material: The outdoor rope lights is covered by transparent PVC hose, which can protect the lighting effect and prolong the bulb lifespan. The tube lights is soft and flexible easy to bend into any shape that you desire. In addition, it light enough to carry conveniently for outdoor decoration, enjoying the immeasurable joy with your family when having a picnic under the stars. 8 lighting modes: Gorgeous 8 lighting modes including combination, flashing, wave, sequential, chasing, fading slowly, twinkle and steady on. According your mood or festival atmosphere to change each lighting mode simply click the ‘MODE’ button. And the fairy lights come with memory chip save the last mode you setting, not need to reset everyday. Indulging in charming and romantic ambiance in every moment. Utility solar strip lights for multipurpose: Each pack has 100 super bright LED on 32.8ft solar strip lights with steady brightness which will illuminate every direction. Ideal for indoor & outdoor decor bed, cabinet, closet, chair, swings, patio, gazebo, roof and tree trunk, to name a few. It is also a perfect way to create a cool vibe for various festivals, like Christmas, New Year, Halloween and Independence Day. High quality solar string lights: PVC protective layer comes with heat-resistant, emitting low heat after long-term use safe for your children and pets. Wrapping with clean hose, which can effectively prevent water. IP65 waterproof degree can conveniently place in any outdoor decor worry-free rainy day. 800Amh battery build-in, solar outdoor rope lights can run 10-12 hours when full charge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bUoYuKk-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wstan","source_asin":"B093G9B1G7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093G9B1G7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093G9B1G7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
