window.products.push({"id":586408,"name":"Scentsationals Eclectic Folia Collection - Boho Scented Electric Wax Warmer - Illuminating & Refreshing Fragrance Wax Cube Melter Air Freshener - Ench","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eeAZndHxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SCENTED WAX WARMER - Folia Wax Warmers combine light, fragrance and artistic design to create a unique, personalized ambiance in any room. The soft light melts scented wax and provides a relaxing atmosphere while filling the room with a wonderful aroma. AMAZING FRAGRANCES - ScentSationals is the leader in wax warmers and wax melts. Choose from hundreds of different scents of waxes to use with your new wax burner. ScentSationals scented wax fragrance families include; Fresh, Floral, Wood, Fruit, Bakery and Spice. (Wax cubes sold separately) SAFE OPERATION - Our wax warmers do not use open flames or have soot residue. It's an easy-to-use and clean heat source. They connect to a standard outlet with a 120 volt cord and have an on/off dial to easily operate. The light bulb (included) heats up the wax that's on the wax dish. As the wax melts, fragrances will fill the room. EASY CLEANUP & REUSE - There are multiple ways to clean wax warmers to prepare for a new wax cube. 1) Cotton Ball Method: Add cotton balls to soak up majority of the wax, turn off and wait until wax cools, then throw away cotton balls and wipe down hot plate. 2) Soft Wax Method: Let wax cool, turn on warmer for 2-3 minutes, then remove softened wax. SATISFIED CUSTOMERS - ScentSationals has had millions of satisfied customers. Each wax burner that we have goes through multiple extensive tests to ensure safety and quality. If you're looking to freshen up your home, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, or any other rooms in your house, this is your top solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eeAZndHxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scentsationals","source_asin":"B0BTFLBF2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTFLBF2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTFLBF2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":586409,"name":"Korean Celadon Glaze Inlaid Ten Creatures of Longevity Inlay Design Green Decorative Porcelain Ceramic Pottery Home Decor Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414ZU4NfReL._AC_.jpg","description":"One of the most favored designs for Korean art traditionally has been sipjangsaeng, 10 creatures that ancient Koreans, influenced by the Taoist philosophy, believed were created to enjoy eternal youth: sun, stone, water, cloud, pine tree, deer, bulnocho ('herb of eternal youth'), turtle, crane, and mountain. Inspired by the belief in a Taoist utopian world resided by Taoist elders who had found the secret of eternal life, ancient Koreans revealed their dreams of such a world through the 10 creatures. These symbols significantly impacted the lives and thoughts of the Korean people, from royalty down to common folks, and appeared in numerous objects and places including walls, paintings, poetry, proverbs, furniture, personal belongings and ornaments. In this ceramic bottle, the design of 10 creatures is exquisitely inlaid into the surface of the jade-blue body. Korean celadon pottery is renowned the world over since Goryeo Dynasty (918-1392) for its exquisite inlaid designs, voluminous form, elegantly-curved lines and mysterious color, the color of the sky after a rainstorm during an autumn afternoon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414ZU4NfReL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Diginex","source_asin":"B005M8G2YS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005M8G2YS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005M8G2YS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
