window.products.push({"id":586455,"name":"Christopher Knight Home Jenna Modern Iron Firescreen with Leaf Accents, Gold Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c62TodtSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Warm up on a cold night next to a snug fire with the help of our outstanding fireplace screen. This fireplace screen offers a sleek accent to your living room or bedroom while providing protection from hot embers or flying sparks with its fine mesh screen. This three-panel screen is foldable, making this extremely convenient to use. Featuring a gently curved top and a cheery leaf pattern, this accessory highlights both functionality and style to give your home the best of the best. Includes: One (1) Fire Screen Material: Iron Finish: Gold No Assembly Required Hand Crafted Details Dimensions: 1. 25 inches deep x 41. 00 inches wide x 31. 00 inches high .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c62TodtSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Christopher Knight Home","source_asin":"B07PJZL5PH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PJZL5PH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PJZL5PH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":586456,"name":"Alpaca Home | 100% Pure Premium Alpaca Wool Throw Blanket • Herringbone • Ethically Sourced | Hypoallergenic - Cozier, Softer & Warmer Than Wool | 71 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":195.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mZU0mORnL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"LUXURIOUS QUALITY: Made from pure premium 100% Royal Baby Alpaca Wool-The finest and rarest alpaca wool available. Less than one percent of all alpaca is “Royal” making these pieces incredibly soft, warm, and lusciously cozy. We work solely with alpaca fibers and take pride in brining you our finest creations, made to the highest standards and in a way that is fully conscious and sustainable. WARMER & LIGHTER: 100% Royal Baby Alpaca fiber will keep you in pure bliss - all wrapped into a sustainable, all-natural, feather-light, warm yet surprisingly thin throw blanket. Within each minuscule hair are pockets of air which act as natures perfect insulator - trapping air that is warmed from your body, while wicking the humidity away. Ever get hot under your blanket? Your old blanket is holding humidity in and its compounding. Alpaca solves that keeping you at cozy without overheating. NO LANOLIN, NO ITCH: Alpaca creates a unique wool that is completely hypoallergenic. Sheep’s wool gets its itchiness from rough scales on the outside of each hair and many find their skin reacts to the lanolin. Alpaca Fiber is smooth and lanolin free, never causing a reaction. ETHICALLY & SUSTAINABLY SOURCED: All of our Alpaca wool is ethically sourced from small farmers. By choosing one of our alpaca throws, you are supporting alpaca farming families who live in the highlands of Peru. Your purchase assists them with food, education, and easier living, while benefiting the alpacas lives too! LIMITED PRODUCTION: Our limited-edition throws are woven in small batches where master weavers create and hand finish our products to the highest standards. We are small US women owned and operated business, since 1997 and stand behind the exceptional quality of everything we sell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mZU0mORnL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alpaca Home","source_asin":"B07G2RGHVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G2RGHVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G2RGHVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
