window.products.push({"id":586467,"name":"Core Bamboo The Cheesy Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KQfZ+jTLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Who said serving cheese and fruit had to be a stuffy affair? The Cheesy Board by Core Bamboo is a fun and whisical way to slice and serve cheese. Shaped like a wedge of cheese, and made to resemble your favorite swiss, cut and serve directly on this tray; A cheese knife proudly displays its name and lays neatly in the board for storage. This board is a great conversation piece and brings a touch of light-heartedness to your entertaining table. A fun display piece for for all kinds of cheeses, the board is a perfect pairing for your next barbecue or casual dinner, this Cheese Serving Set is a gift you'll want to give, and one you'll want to keep Core Bamboo is committed to creating superior products, while taking care of the people who create them, and the environment that provides the resources. Bamboo is one of the most remarkable resources available, regenerating itself every 4 years. This fact, along with understanding bamboo is stronger than maple and lighter than oak, and has naturally antiseptic properties, makes bamboo the perfect choice for wood products for the home. All bamboo used by Core Bamboo is 100-Percent organically grown, with vibrant colors achieved using food-safe, water-based adhesives and natural oils. Each product meets FDA and European Food Safety guidelines. Exceptional products and a belief in ethical and social responsibility; it is no wonder Core Home continues to win honors and awards by its peers, while customers order Core products again and again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KQfZ+jTLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Core Bamboo","source_asin":"B0083V93AG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0083V93AG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0083V93AG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
