window.products.push({"id":586704,"name":"Cashmere Boutique: 100% Pure Cashmere Travel Throw Set (8 Colors, One Size)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e6gYAztPL._AC_UL1398_.jpg","description":"Cashmere Imported Machine Wash Grade A 100% Cashmere in 4-Ply: Our cashmere travel throw set offers an enhanced sense of softness and warmth during cold days. You will enjoy the look and feel of our high quality smooth and fluffy cashmere travel throw set. Perfect to use on flights as your own personal blanket or as a shawl in the cool evenings. Handy for your frequent travels. Extremely cozy for those chilly cruise days. Folds and fits into its own travel case. Light weight and small enough to fit in your carry on or purse. Makes a great Mothers' day, Father's Day, Anniversary, Birthday, Graduation or Christmas gift. Can also be used as a gift for new born babies. Babies love soft snuggly blankets. This Travel set makes a great corporate gift for companies big and small, or golf, soccer, hockey tournaments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e6gYAztPL._AC_UL1398_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cashmere Boutique","source_asin":"B00YDK6IS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YDK6IS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YDK6IS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":586705,"name":"Cottone 100% Cotton Bench Pads w/ Ties (Set of 2) | 42” x 16”| Extra-Comfortable & Soft Bench Cushions | Ergonomic Pillows for Dining, Patio, Camping,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q4dLwkjyL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Cottone Cottone is all about treating you to affordable everyday elegance. We believe you don’t have to pay a premium to get products that look great, work great, and last. That’s why we use premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. The Chair Pad Set You’ll Love Sinking Into Make your hard chairs a joy to seat on with a chair pad set designed with durable comfort in mind! Cotton chair and bench cushions stand out with their impressively soft cotton cover, extra-comfy cotton filling, and great support. Upgrade your chairs with cotton chair cushions that will feel great years down the line. - Non-irritating and non-static cushion. - Tufted to prevent flattening out. - Multiple ties at the back for non-slip use. - Extra-strong stitching at the seams. - Multiple color and size options. Comfort of Cotton No more scratchiness. No more getting hit by static every time you get up. Cottone chair and bench pads buck the cheap synthetic trend by using 100% cotton not only on the cover but also in the filling. So you end up with a seat cushion with a superior softness and comfort you’ll love. Experience the difference of a chair seat pad that goes natural. Great Fitting Design Cottone pads easily fit the seat of most chairs and benches come in numerous size options for a great fit. Whether you have a rocking chair that needs softening, a high chair that could use a bit more cushion, or a patio chair that needs some comfort upgrading, our pads get the job done without much fuss and have ties to prevent any sliding. Beautiful Color Options Match your furniture or spruce it up with an eye-catching touch of color with the beautiful hues of our chair and bench pads. Cottone seat cushions come in striking shades of white, red, orange, lime green, navy blue, grey, off white, or striped designs, which retain their lovely look even after being washed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q4dLwkjyL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cottone","source_asin":"B07B4MYY8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B4MYY8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B4MYY8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
