window.products.push({"id":586723,"name":"Nautical Placemats Puget Sound South (WA)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91olqoVueVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hmm I believe at the time she had a key or the door was open already. The last time she did she left the keys in the apartment or they were mailed back. I’d have to go back through my messages to be 100% sure. Once you’re at the very top of the driveway and parked in the circular turnaround area... The main building has a buzzer system that will get you in. As you enter the main part of the building there is a large staircase on your right. Before the staircase On your left is a door (it sort of blends in to the wall) that will take you to the elevator. The mail is located on the bottom floor in the garage. Exit the elevator and go through the second door on your right. Mailboxes are on the other end once you’re through that door. Be careful because the door will lock behind you and requires a code. I do not know that code. Todd would know that codes though if needed. The main entrance door is *0664 I believe. Probably should check with todd on that to be sure. Todd’s apartment is on the 3rd floor. When you exit the elevator it’s on your right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91olqoVueVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nautical Placemats","source_asin":"B07WYZYVZ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WYZYVZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WYZYVZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
