window.products.push({"id":586790,"name":"Textured 4x9 Cool Citrus Basil Pillar Candle for Wedding/Dinner, Holiday Event, Home Decoration, 100 to 120 Hours, 4 in. diameterx9.25 in. Tall, 1 Pie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MXPJWvfyL._AC_.jpg","description":"We make our textured 4x9 cool citrus basil scented candles using a process that causes them to have a rough, stone like finish when they harden. These rustic candles have a beautiful contrast with the smooth straight edges in a modern home. Surrounding them with botanical accents will create an organic, natural look. Our strong fragrances will freshen the air and the flickering candle light will create a relaxing ambiance. Burn the candle long enough for the liquid pool to to almost reach the edge then extinguish the flame. Allow the wax to cool before relighting it again. Doing this will maximize the length of time your candle will burn and allow it to use up nearly all the wax.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MXPJWvfyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SNS","source_asin":"B0738D27KX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0738D27KX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0738D27KX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
