window.products.push({"id":586845,"name":"Proctor Silex Alex's Lemonade Stand Electric Citrus Juicer Machine and Squeezer, for Lemons, Limes and Oranges, 34 oz, Yellow (66331)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TAte+05nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Proctor Silex Alex's lemonade stand citrus juicer eliminates the labor of manual juicing so you can make the most of fresh oranges, lemons, limes and grapefruit. Keep 1 in the kitchen For a quick glass of lemonade and for adding a bright note to homemade dressings, marinades and sauces. 1 of your purchase goes directly to Alex's lemonade stand foundation for Childhood Cancer Research.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TAte+05nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Proctor Silex","source_asin":"B008BBCZ3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008BBCZ3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008BBCZ3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":586846,"name":"Russian Piping Tips 6 PCS, Youthful Stainless Steel Russian Piping Ball Tips Flower Frosting Icing Piping Nozzles Set Cake Decorating Tips Kit for DIY","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WDuKU+GOL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Features: Our russian piping ball tips are made of food grade 304 stainless steel material, seamless welding technology to make, which are exceptionally strong, durable and easy to clean, safe for dish washer.  Just squeeze on your icing bag gently (not included), it will produce frosting from the cake decoration tip and you can create an entire gorgeous flower bud in full bloom.   You'll have everything you need to start decorating your cakes, muffins, cupcakes cookies, desserts and pastry with a professional touch.  You can make beautiful butter cream flowers easily with russian piping nozzles set, such as tulips, roses, and drop flowers etc.  Introductions: 1. Wash the cake decoration tips in hot water. 2. Prepare the piping bag cutting so that 1-2 mm of nozzle can pop out of piping bag. 3. Insert the cake piping nozzle in the bag. 4. Put the buttercream in a bag. Buttercream must be firm, room temperature, not too soft. 5. Place the icing nozzle to the cupcake/cake base,while squeezing gently, life nozzle. 6. If the buttercream is too soft the buds will be closed.Pop in the fridge,if necessary. 7. After use,wash in hot soap water and dry.  Specifications: Material: 304 stainless steel Size: 6.2x3.3cm Color: silver Quatity: 6 pcs  Package Included: 6 x Russian Icing Tips for Cake Decoration  Warm Notices: Before using, please wash the icing nozzles, put them in hot water for a minute or more. Fill the piping bag with butter cream that is at room temperature, not too soft or too firm. Squeeze gently to create a base for the flower and then pull away by 1-2cm to form your flower. After using, we recommend using detergent to clean the icing piping tips inside and outside, put them in hot water for a minute and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WDuKU+GOL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Youthful","source_asin":"B07Q1CF92V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q1CF92V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q1CF92V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
