window.products.push({"id":586854,"name":"100% Natural, Non-toxic Cotton Produce Bags for Food Storage, Keeping Produce Fresher for Longer. Durable Reusable & Washable, Patented Design (Starte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DyUxLCUtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LISTED AS OPRAH'S FAVOURITE SUSTAINABLE PRODUCT: Featured in O Magazine, THE SWAG made 'Oprah's O List' of favourite sustainable products. Described as a \"trusted, easy, and effective solution to reduce BOTH food waste and plastic\", our award-winning reusable produce bags are a premium produce storage solution that's eco-friendly, compostable and recyclable. THE SWAG is proudly built to last YEARS, however at the end of its very long life it will decompose within months when composted. SCIENTIFICALLY PROVEN TO KEEP PRODUCE FRESH FOR LONGER : Applied Horticulture Research 2021 storage trial showed these washable cotton bags, when DAMPENED DOWN, kept fruits and vegetables cool, crisp, and fresh for 2 weeks or more (in some cases up to 4 weeks) after being placed in the refrigerator. This will not only reduce food wastage, but also help you save money! PLUS, there’s no need to plastic wrap half used produce; just pop it back into THE SWAG and it will stay fresh (no slimy edges). MADE FROM 100% NATURAL NON-TOXIC COTTON: Eliminate toxic residue on your foods by storing produce in our chemical-free bag, made from sustainable unseeded & unbleached cotton. Storing produce in materials like plastic, silicone, paper towel and aluminium foil, can result in produce absorbing highly toxic chemicals that can leach out and end up in your body. DESIGNED FOR PRACTICALITY & ORGANISATION: Each bag in The Starter Pack has different coloured trims to identify sizes & implement an organisation system. The assortment of bags accommodates different sized produce & help organise produce depending on category and/or freshness. This system also means you can put one SWAG in the washing machine ready for your next shop! This set includes 4 SWAGS; 1 Large (16.5\"x20.5\" flap open/15\" flap closed), 1 Long (20.5\"x15\"/9.5\"), & 2 Small (14.5\"x15\"/9.5\"). AWARD WINNING PATENTED TECHNOLOGY: Winner of the Australian Non-toxic awards 2020 and People's Choice Awards Australia/New Zealand 2021, THE SWAG is certified Ethical & Fair-Trade (SEDEX) and was voted as \"safe, ethical, sustainable and responsible\". The patented multi-layer breathable design provides an intelligent system to ensure produce stays protected and perfectly hydrated. MADE TO LAST YEARS & COMPOSTABLE: Our high quality produce bags are hand-made from 100% natural unbleached and unseeded cotton. They are designed to last for several years before being fully composted at the end of its very long life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DyUxLCUtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Swag 100% Natural","source_asin":"B09JVJ42HK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JVJ42HK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JVJ42HK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
