window.products.push({"id":586992,"name":"Portmeirion Sophie Conran Celadon Cereal Bowl, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31wL1aTPBhL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Sophie Conran Collection was designed exclusively for Portmeirion. This collection is as durable and functional as it is beautiful. Sophie is part of the world-famous Conran lifestyle and culinary dynasty. The simplistic and organic nature of this collection makes it perfect for every style and taste. Each beautifully delicate item meets the hard-wearing needs of today's family and culinary experts. Available in White, Bisque and Celadon, the look can be as simple or diverse as your tastes demand. Amazon.com This simple, beautiful, and functional cereal bowl is part of an entire tableware and bakeware collection designed by Sophie Conran, an English food writer with her own gourmet pie company. Conran infuses her namesake tableware with a flowing organic nature and tactile expression, as evidenced by the ridges and dipped rims that recall handcrafted pottery. Made of porcelain expressly for Portmeirion, the collection comes in glossy white with select pieces available in cool blue celadon and a creamy biscuit color. The six-inch cereal bowl, with its slightly wavy and uneven sides, exudes a rustic yet modern appeal. Perfect for hot oatmeal or cold muesli, the everyday bowl is also an ideal size for soup, chili, yogurt and fruit, or ice cream. A wider, rimmed soup bowl is also available in the collection. Like all Sophie Conran dinnerware, the four bowls in this set are lightweight but surprisingly durable, safe for use in the freezer, microwave, oven, and dishwasher. The set makes a great gift for someone who appreciates life's simple pleasures. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31wL1aTPBhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Portmeirion","source_asin":"B079MHX698","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-586992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079MHX698","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079MHX698","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
